  "description": "Native Avalonia terminal control for .NET. VT500-class parser (CSI / OSC / DCS / APC, full SGR including 24-bit RGB and SGR 4:N curly underline), reflow on resize, scrollback, OSC 8 hyperlinks, OSC 133 semantic prompts, OSC 7 working-directory tracking, OSC 9;4 progress, OSC 4 / 10 / 11 / 12 dynamic palette, programming-font ligatures, mouse reporting (1006 / 1016), modifyOtherKeys level 2, synchronized output (DECSET 2026), parser extensibility hooks, markers and decorations, custom link providers, VS16 emoji presentation, write coalescing with backpressure, and recovery primitives. No PTY plumbing — wire bytes via Write() and the Input / Resized events.",
